        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, Cody Hanson, Cathal Coughlan\n- Bands: Hinder, The Fatima Mansions, Microdisney\n- Songs: \"Get Stoned\"\n- Places: Oklahoma, Cork\n\nFacts:\n- Hinder is an American rock band from Oklahoma that was formed in 2001 by Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, and Cody Hanson.\n- The Fatima Mansions were an art rock group formed in 1988 by Cork singer and keyboardist Cathal Coughlan.\n- Cathal Coughlan was formerly a member of Microdisney.\n- \"Get Stoned\" is a song by the American rock band Hinder.",
